      "content": "okay fine, i wont double up if you say so. but i really feel like it's just a migraine... the pain is intense but i've been through this before. i have some extra ibuprofen and some naproxen here too, would it be safe to take those with the sumatriptan? i just need the pain to stop so i can sleep.",
